                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On December 21, 1951, the Department sent to all diplomatic, TCA, and ECA
                    missions in the Far East and South Asia a circular airgram on the subject
                    “Relationship With Japan and Production of Essential Materials.” For text, see
                        <ref target="#pg126">page 126</ref>.</p>
            </div>
